		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Ornately garbed female skeleton with cascading black hair, adorned with flowers. Psychopomps usher spirits into the afterlife.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 14, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +2 (1d8) or compel or kiss of death, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Compel</strong>. One mortal within near, WIS 15+ or compelled to approach catrina and kiss her. Repeat check each round.</p><p></p><p><strong>Kiss of Death</strong>. Kiss a helpless or willing target, 4d6 damage per round.</p><p></p><p><strong>Magical Being</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
